{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0353_1000_p", "source_sha256": "04841a7e66afbafb4e0d7cf05d4deee410d4239b5909ebdbdbfd0a7068193018", "ja": "（ライブが終わり、静香を駅まで送ることになった。\n歩きながら、今日のことを振り返っていると……）", "zh": "（演出结束后，我要送静香去车站。我们一边走，一边回想着今天发生的事……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0353_1001_p", "source_sha256": "203340c029f0e66aaa14c6f1c85fa49e203a1323e10620e0ee26b7cab96f261f", "ja": "改めて、お疲れ様。\n今日もいいステージだったな。", "zh": "再次辛苦了。\n今天也是一场很棒的演出啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0353_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "6711d11a660cb1fab2574866fccf1b11d07c035393f324847ea64b9801ec62c9", "ja": "そうですね。開演前からみんなの気合いがすごくて。\n私も、力みすぎないか心配だったんです。", "zh": "是啊。大家从开演前就干劲十足的。\n我也担心自己会不会用力过猛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0353_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "73aec9b3eaca15e0fff457457d2117b625091cdc2d9eb6470fff90fc980b81d3", "ja": "でもステージに立ったら、理想どおりのステージングが\nできて……。手ごたえを感じてます。", "zh": "不过站上舞台后，呈现出了理想中的舞台效果……我感觉这次很有收获。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0353_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e05caec375ec08007628f07092a279e1631858590440186d5b7a221fa6b9ccce", "ja": "そうか。日頃から、きちんとレッスンしてる賜物だな。\nだからこそ、会場中を魅了できたんだ。", "zh": "这样啊。看来是平日认真训练的成果。正因如此，才能让整个会场为之倾倒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0353_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "ec28d75af6ef455b0726245e43697d8c23ebf669ac5e444aefb28685318379eb", "ja": "そ、そうですか……。{$P$}から\n見ても、ちゃんと出来ていたなら、よかったです。", "zh": "这、这样啊……如果从{$P$}看来，我也做得不错，那就太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0353_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "9f29c3381c1a073eab3acc39939ab471503375075d0bcf8f00004e8f0a4ea2da", "ja": "ソロパートを任されたからには、\n中途半端なものは届けたくないと思っていたので。", "zh": "既然被交付了独唱部分，我就不想呈现半吊子的表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0353_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a0cc1bb3b203a09b2a1a6957a35cc78c41b4bb5a1c295d4cfc4e77771651c529", "ja": "それで練習量を増やしたのか……。\n大丈夫。静香の頑張りは、ちゃんと届いてる。", "zh": "所以你才增加了练习量啊……\n没关系。静香的努力，确实传达到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0353_1008_p", "source_sha256": "14162c96c101df4c294355952a8bee5f48f6e9be1202ab3c1867c73281f55a0d", "ja": "歌い終わった後の拍手は、一番大きかった。\n見た人達の心に響いたってことだと思うよ。", "zh": "唱完之后的掌声是最大的。\n我觉得，这就说明你的歌声打动了观众的心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0353_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "c5281b41306a721db086198bb5b60157dd4e11f296a3c8523dffd3872b02be0f", "ja": "{$P$}……。\n……あの、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n……那个，谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
